    "code": " def sum_digit(a):\n\n    k=a\n\n    dem=0\n\n    while k>0:\n\n        x=k%10\n\n        dem+=x\n\n        k=int(k/10)\n\n    return (dem)\n\nch=input()\n\nn=int(ch)\n\nch=str(n)\n\nif len(ch)>1:\n\n    n1=str(int(ch[0])-1)\n\n    if n1=='0':\n\n        n1=''\n\n    for i in range(len(ch)-1):\n\n        n1+='9'\n\n    x=int(n1)\n\n    y=n-x\n\n    print (sum_digit(x)+sum_digit(y)) \n\nelse:\n\n    print (n)",
